# Only what the API and its migrations read goes into the image. database/schema.sql
# is applied by migration 0001 to an empty PostgreSQL database.
# Everything else is excluded so secrets and local state never end up in a layer.
*
!app/
!migrations/
!database/schema.sql
!database/migrations/
!alembic.ini
!requirements.txt
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
